# ---- HAVING: a value in CASE ----

# A value in a WHEN (one row; no row sends every group to the ELSE), as a THEN and as an ELSE value; CASE x WHEN
# with a value as the operand compared with a GROUP BY key, with a value in the WHEN and with a NULL row's operand
# (no WHEN matches); a two-row value in a branch no group takes still fails.

query II nosort
